        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Purify the beautiful yet deadly anomalies!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mythical beings are plunging the world into chaos — each one alluring in her own way, yet powerful enough to test every ounce of your strength. Your mission is simple: <strong>Purify them.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966010/extras/cd397c1a78eedf26548bf0f15f03f42e.poster.avif?t=1766818125\" width=1170 height=741 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966010/extras/cd397c1a78eedf26548bf0f15f03f42e.webm?t=1766818125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>2D Pixel-Art Action Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Soul Demon Hunters</strong> is a fast-paced 2D pixel-art action game where every region features different structures, threats, and combat patterns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The anomalies you must purify are fearsome — but the battles are fast, stylish, and incredibly satisfying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966010/extras/e37635d730519275c2cb3f467e3cfded.avif?t=1766818125\" width=1270 height=260 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Background</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anomalies that once existed only in myths and legends have begun appearing across the real world.<br>Beautiful, dangerous, and awakened from folklore, these beings now threaten global stability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To stop this chaos, <strong>James — an exorcist of the Soul Demon Hunters (that’s you, sir!) — sets out on a worldwide journey</strong> to purify them one by one. Only you have the power to halt the spread of these mythic forces. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966010/extras/7cfac462a92a3d3a6d9f08a4bf6d4112.poster.avif?t=1766818125\" width=1170 height=740 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966010/extras/7cfac462a92a3d3a6d9f08a4bf6d4112.webm?t=1766818125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966010/extras/7db2c7a4b7ae75308f1eebe695f8e447.avif?t=1766818125\" width=1270 height=260 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Purpose of Purification – For the Peace of Humanity</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As James, you will hunt relentless waves of anomalies, confront them head-on, and prove your strength.<br>The stronger you become, the longer you survive — and the more purifications you can perform.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For the peace of humanity… keep fighting, James!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966010/extras/e2ebe7aa70ff4b4c939fec2f660fce85.poster.avif?t=1766818125\" width=1170 height=740 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966010/extras/e2ebe7aa70ff4b4c939fec2f660fce85.webm?t=1766818125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966010/extras/a0bde39773d718e6d310b591948f915c.avif?t=1766818125\" width=1270 height=260 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Transform Your Combat Style with Weapon Combinations</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the resources and materials you earn in battle to unlock new weapons and Exorcism Powers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lightsabers straight out of a sci-fi movie,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sacred relics worthy of ancient legends,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >…to adorable cat-themed weapons(?)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own build with dozens of combinations. But nothing comes for free — <strong>every weapon must be earned and crafted by you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966010/extras/387d302ee61d09dd4f1c26fd318dbb88.poster.avif?t=1766818125\" width=1170 height=740 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966010/extras/387d302ee61d09dd4f1c26fd318dbb88.webm?t=1766818125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966010/extras/79258b336c036b5c9c7979ad7cfe7ebe.avif?t=1766818125\" width=1270 height=260 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Encounter Various Anomalies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of each region, a legendary female anomaly awaits.<br>Each one:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Originates from a completely different mythology</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Possesses unique supernatural skills and attack patterns</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grows more provocative and challenging the stronger you become</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To purify these beautiful but deadly beings, you’ll need focus, a smart build, and unwavering power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966010/extras/f0df1d887d33de3f1822308bca5ccf84.poster.avif?t=1766818125\" width=1170 height=740 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966010/extras/f0df1d887d33de3f1822308bca5ccf84.webm?t=1766818125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966010/extras/4b350258f1bb87c657cb435c822b81c7.avif?t=1766818125\" width=1270 height=260 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>✨ Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A modern take on classic 2D pixel-art action.</strong> Crisp animation, expressive characters, stylish effects, and a retro aesthetic refined for today’s players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-paced side-scrolling combat.</strong> Dash, dodge, slash, purify—master James’s exorcist skills to survive intensifying waves of supernatural threats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Six beautifully deadly bosses.</strong> Each inspired by local myths around the world, armed with unique supernatural abilities and unforgettable personalities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless monster waves!</strong> Push your reflexes to the limit as enemies swarm from every direction—stay sharp and stay alive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect mysterious field items.</strong> Discover artifacts that unleash powerful effects, change builds, or help you survive impossible situations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mr. Lee’s Weapon Shop.</strong> Gather money during battle and purchase weapon recipes to craft everything from laser-like blades to legendary relics… and even a cute cat weapon.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade through the Battle Shop.</strong> Improve your stats, enhance your abilities, and shape your combat style after each boss encounter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Train inside the Bunker.</strong> Strengthen your body, unlock new skills, and push beyond human limits—power always comes with sacrifice.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hunter Network System.</strong> Recruit new playable hunters, each with their own abilities, skill awakenings, and unique combat identity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Big, beautiful pixel art.</strong> Detailed effects, dynamic animations, expressive characters, and handcrafted backgrounds bring every region to life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Charming characters &amp; treacherous foes.</strong> From seductive bosses to strange anomalies, every encounter leaves a lasting impression.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Balanced for everyone.</strong> Easy to pick up, satisfying to master—newcomers and action experts will both find the perfect challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Global folklore, reimagined.</strong> Travel across regions inspired by myths and legends from around the world and purify the anomalies born from them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New Game+ for the brave.</strong> After surviving your first hunt, return stronger and push the challenge to the next level.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We’re also preparing stage-specific quests, a full original soundtrack, and even an adult-oriented IPU (I Will Purify You) version as well. <strong>All of these will be released soon—so add the game to your Wishlist now and get ready for the hunt!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
